<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib and loin cuts steady to firm, while chuck and round cuts firm.  Beef trimmings firm on light to moderate demand  and offerings. -</p>
<p>USDA------</p>
<p>271 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 18 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
